  "question": "Does the literal appearance of 图书文件下载（TXT） and 目录附件下载 on National Library of China Press product 4396 prove that product-specific attachment objects exist for 《文津学志（第三辑）》?",
  "answer": "No. The literal labels on product 4396 remain a valid first-party page observation, but cross-product controls show the same pair of labels recurring unchanged on multiple other NLC Press product pages across 2016, 2020 and 2024, and even on a future-dated 2030 product listing that currently exposes no directory block. Combined with Batch 12GY's global public resource-center nonlisting for product 4396, the labels are best classified as generic/template-like related-download controls. Label presence alone is insufficient to establish that product 4396 has product-specific TXT/TOC attachment objects. Product-specific attachment-object existence, direct URLs and bytes remain unresolved. This forward revision supersedes only the evidence-strength interpretation in 12GX/12GY; it does not erase their literal observations and changes no chart rule, Matrix row, genealogy edge or product invariant.",
